{"id":"daily-161-the-wobbly-tooth","slug":"daily-161-the-wobbly-tooth","title":"The Wobbly Tooth","title_ko":"흔들리는 이","level":"A1","ageBand":"8-10","coverUrl":"/seed/daily-161-the-wobbly-tooth/cover.webp","summary_ko":"Jun의 앞니가 흔들리기 시작하고, 엄마의 도움을 받아 마침내 이가 쏙 빠지는 두근두근한 하루를 담은 이야기입니다.","wordCount":99,"stage":2,"collection":"daily","pages":[{"id":"daily-161-the-wobbly-tooth-p1","pageNo":1,"spread":"p1","imageUrl":"/seed/daily-161-the-wobbly-tooth/p1.webp","sentences":[{"id":"daily-161-the-wobbly-tooth-p1-s1","ord":0,"text":"Jun was eating breakfast, but something felt strange.","translation_ko":"Jun은 아침을 먹고 있었는데, 뭔가 이상한 느낌이 들었어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-161-the-wobbly-tooth/audio/p1-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Jun","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":480},{"word":"was","charStart":4,"charEnd":7,"startMs":480,"endMs":740},{"word":"eating","charStart":8,"charEnd":14,"startMs":740,"endMs":1060},{"word":"breakfast","charStart":15,"charEnd":24,"startMs":1060,"endMs":1580},{"word":"but","charStart":26,"charEnd":29,"startMs":2040,"endMs":2140},{"word":"something","charStart":30,"charEnd":39,"startMs":2140,"endMs":2520},{"word":"felt","charStart":40,"charEnd":44,"startMs":2520,"endMs":2940},{"word":"strange","charStart":45,"charEnd":52,"startMs":2940,"endMs":3440}]}]},{"id":"daily-161-the-wobbly-tooth-p2","pageNo":2,"spread":"p2","imageUrl":"/seed/daily-161-the-wobbly-tooth/p2.webp","sentences":[{"id":"daily-161-the-wobbly-tooth-p2-s1","ord":0,"text":"His front tooth was wobbly!","translation_ko":"앞니가 흔들리고 있었어요!","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-161-the-wobbly-tooth/audio/p2-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"His","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":380},{"word":"front","charStart":4,"charEnd":9,"startMs":380,"endMs":940},{"word":"tooth","charStart":10,"charEnd":15,"startMs":940,"endMs":1280},{"word":"was","charStart":16,"charEnd":19,"startMs":1280,"endMs":1580},{"word":"wobbly","charStart":20,"charEnd":26,"startMs":1580,"endMs":1920}]},{"id":"daily-161-the-wobbly-tooth-p2-s2","ord":1,"text":"Jun touched it with his tongue.","translation_ko":"Jun은 혀로 이를 건드려 봤어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-161-the-wobbly-tooth/audio/p2-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Jun","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":480},{"word":"touched","charStart":4,"charEnd":11,"startMs":480,"endMs":880},{"word":"it","charStart":12,"charEnd":14,"startMs":880,"endMs":1080},{"word":"with","charStart":15,"charEnd":19,"startMs":1080,"endMs":1240},{"word":"his","charStart":20,"charEnd":23,"startMs":1240,"endMs":1460},{"word":"tongue","charStart":24,"charEnd":30,"startMs":1460,"endMs":1720}]}]},{"id":"daily-161-the-wobbly-tooth-p3","pageNo":3,"spread":"p3","imageUrl":"/seed/daily-161-the-wobbly-tooth/p3.webp","sentences":[{"id":"daily-161-the-wobbly-tooth-p3-s1","ord":0,"text":"\"Mom, my tooth is moving!\" Jun said.","translation_ko":"\"엄마, 제 이가 흔들려요!\" Jun이 말했어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-161-the-wobbly-tooth/audio/p3-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Mom","charStart":1,"charEnd":4,"startMs":0,"endMs":500},{"word":"my","charStart":6,"charEnd":8,"startMs":800,"endMs":980},{"word":"tooth","charStart":9,"charEnd":14,"startMs":980,"endMs":1200},{"word":"is","charStart":15,"charEnd":17,"startMs":1200,"endMs":1460},{"word":"moving","charStart":18,"charEnd":24,"startMs":1460,"endMs":2520},{"word":"Jun","charStart":27,"charEnd":30,"startMs":2520,"endMs":2580},{"word":"said","charStart":31,"charEnd":35,"startMs":2580,"endMs":2880}]}]},{"id":"daily-161-the-wobbly-tooth-p4","pageNo":4,"spread":"p4","imageUrl":"/seed/daily-161-the-wobbly-tooth/p4.webp","sentences":[{"id":"daily-161-the-wobbly-tooth-p4-s1","ord":0,"text":"Mom looked at his tooth and smiled.","translation_ko":"엄마는 Jun의 이를 살펴보고 미소 지었어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-161-the-wobbly-tooth/audio/p4-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Mom","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":540},{"word":"looked","charStart":4,"charEnd":10,"startMs":540,"endMs":980},{"word":"at","charStart":11,"charEnd":13,"startMs":980,"endMs":116